  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-ag60dABl\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6BegWE60\">本文介绍如何「获取企业微信webhook url」</p></blockquote><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%229EqZD%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-rU9cfO0W%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3Ewebhook%20Url%20%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%3C%2Fstrong%3E%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87weebhook%20url%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%81%E8%87%B3%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E7%BE%A4%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%BF%E4%BA%8E%E5%9C%A8%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E7%AB%AF%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rU9cfO0W\"><strong>webhook Url 作用</strong>：当脚本运行输出结果后，可通过weebhook url回调的方式，将结果推送至企业微信群，便于在企业微信端查看数据。</p></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-MVQuvu0E\"><strong>第一步：创建企业微信群</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-LDT1bqW0\">首先，创建一个需要接收消息的企业微信群</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-9HZwjOiY\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-jjk21i4l\"><strong>第二步：在微信群内添加机器人</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-3uq6jAa8\">最终消息会通过机器人在群内推送</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t75ae23f-LKmmDB1V\" class=\"data-table\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-0UX1E2Ug\"><col width=\"37.65642775881683%\" data-id=\"c68e2e9a-CVOFOQS0\" span=\"1\"><col width=\"62.34357224118317%\" data-id=\"c47fe5e2-PHSGCTgM\" span=\"1\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-FVVfFAWX\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-gYF0RTMl\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-XWMf98lQ\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bDZfRPc9\">通过群右上角“...”进入添加机器人页面</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-2TB05h90\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-D0YN8mAE\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/d4d9b6b746314508820d64c442a94d10~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2026372131&amp;x-signature=d82Nszu9lHSBckHLFh7VC9MKemA%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-0Ka0dDCl\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-OODVUEBk\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jVFbmgfQ\">1、新建机器人</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-U18XULFX\">2、填写机器人名称、头像</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-1HcDN240\">3、添加机器人</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-K3BFgcTn\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HKKC3eLh\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/0009fb7eaf194f58a813af7d9565daf2~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2026372218&amp;x-signature=n%2FEEKFmUuPkGgxibtq%2FPqZwG7qg%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/2fd9ce81af344525a0e9f1d0cb77444d~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2026372237&amp;x-signature=BNva6DUIAj8ntD6vUkd9ad2RAOk%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-6V6XhPg2\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-b3V6BZiL\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KboVmidV\">复制地址</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t16089ba-YFaZ1Y0K\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EIGH6kQR\"><img src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/86b1ef71322149019b92674503bcf8bc~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2026372371&amp;x-signature=IqOOWQYQ5J2zVmOTcdI9GlW8ZeE%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-u87oCdZZ\">例如：https://qyapi.weixin.qq.com/cgi-bin/webhook/send?key=xxxx，将该链接复制到脚本的wehookurl处</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-DFZ8IT7v\"><br></p></div>",
